# Leftovers of the Python prototype (root-owned caches may remain locally)
daemon/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Notes: the measurements are published, the rest is not.
#
# `notes/findings/` is the record of what was measured and what it proved, including the dead
# ends — it is the most useful thing in this repository for anyone trying the same thing, and the
# README links to it. The plan, the archive and the reverse-engineering notes stay private: they
# are working papers, they name things that are not mine to publish, and they would be read as
# documentation when they are not.
notes/*
!notes/findings/
notes/findings/*.tmp
